        <tr><td>Missing or lifted shingles</td><td>Leak after high wind; shingles in the yard</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Flashing at chimneys, walls and skylights</td><td>Stain near a chimney or skylight; leak in wind-driven rain</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Plumbing vent boots</td><td>Stain on a bathroom or kitchen ceiling below a vent pipe</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Ice dams</td><td>Leak at exterior walls in winter, during a thaw</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Clogged gutters</td><td>Water at the top of exterior walls or soffits during heavy rain</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Attic condensation</td><td>Damp sheathing and frost in winter with no rain; poor attic ventilation</td></tr>
      </tbody>
